                                "sense_id": "c703aaf2-05cf-35e5-9377-8529d9c93c54",
                                "text": "Supes Awesome. Dating advice from the clown who'd put baby powder in my blow-dryer, frozen marbles in my bed, and still regularly strung plastic wrap across the doorway."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7100ab47-6a23-4e6f-8f23-d46417b5f023",
                                "sense_id": "c703aaf2-05cf-35e5-9377-8529d9c93c54",
                                "text": "It's supes boring here."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "481ff050-aebc-43a2-932e-1d70f719634a",
                                "sense_id": "c703aaf2-05cf-35e5-9377-8529d9c93c54",
                                "text": "It's going to be supes fun."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ad6a7ea-0144-4624-b653-b7c411316230",
                                "sense_id": "c703aaf2-05cf-35e5-9377-8529d9c93c54",
                                "text": "You were like a zombie for a minute there. It was supes scary."
                            }
